e bottom of the north screen, far from Octorocks initially. Snapshot immediately. Should be fine.\n\nLet me also consider: maybe walking up isn't the only exit; but it's the one we know.\n\nLet me proceed. Load state 0.\n\nHmm wait, load_state 0 was saved when emulator was paused. After loading, emulator state is PAUSED? The tool says \"While paused one frame runs so the restore can happen.\" Let me just resume/play.\n\nLet me load_state and snapshot n0. Actually load_state then snapshot.\n\nI'll do load_state 0 and then snapshot n0 and screenshot to confirm.\n\nActually I can't snapshot in the same block as load_state if I need to see result first. load_state then next message.\n\nLet me do it."}
